#, no-wrap
msgid "DIR"
msgstr "DIR"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2024"
msgstr "2024년 8월"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "GNU coreutils 9.5"
msgstr "GNU coreutils 9.5"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "사용자 명령"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "이름"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "dir - list directory contents"
msgstr "dir - 경로의 내용을 나열한다"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "요약"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "B<ls> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... [I<\\,FILE\\/>]..."
msgid "B<dir> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... [I<\\,FILE\\/>]..."
msgstr "B<ls> [I<\\,옵션\\/>]... [I<\\,파일\\/>]..."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "설명"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"List information about the FILEs (the current directory by default).  Sort "
"entries alphabetically if none of B<-cftuvSUX> nor B<--sort> is specified."
msgstr ""
"I<파일>의 정보를 나타냅니다(기본: 현재 디렉터리). B<-cftuvSUX> 또는 B<--"
"sort> 옵션을 지정하지 않으면 항목을 알파벳 순으로 정렬합니다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr "긴 옵션의 필수 인자값은 짧은 옵션에서도 마찬가지입니다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-a>, B<--all>"
msgstr "B<-a>, B<--all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not ignore entries starting with ."
msgstr ". (점)으로 시작하는 항목을 무시하지 않습니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-A>, B<--almost-all>"
msgstr "B<-A>, B<--almost-all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not list implied . and .."
msgstr ". 과 .. 를 목록으로 나타내지 않습니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--author>"
msgstr "B<--author>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "with B<-l>, print the author of each file"
msgstr "B<-l> 옵션을 붙이면, 각 파일의 작성자를 출력합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-b>, B<--escape>"
msgstr "B<-b>, B<--escape>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "print C-style escapes for nongraphic characters"
msgstr "출력할 수 없는 문자를 C언어 방식 이스케이프로 출력합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--block-size>=I<\\,SIZE\\/>"
msgstr "B<--block-size>=I<\\,크기\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"with B<-l>, scale sizes by SIZE when printing them; e.g., '--block-size=M'; "
"see SIZE format below"
msgstr ""
"B<-l> 옵션을 붙여 대상을 출력하면 I<크기> 만큼 블록 크기를 늘립니다, 예: '--"
"block-size=M'. I<크기> 형식은 아래 참조"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-B>, B<--ignore-backups>"
msgstr "B<-B>, B<--ignore-backups>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not list implied entries ending with ~"
msgstr "~ 문자로 끝난 암시 항목을 나타내지 않습니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-c>"
msgstr "B<-c>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"with B<-lt>: sort by, and show, ctime (time of last change of file status "
"information); with B<-l>: show ctime and sort by name; otherwise: sort by "
"ctime, newest first"
msgstr ""
"B<-lt> 옵션 추가: 최종 수정 시각 기준으로 정렬 후 나열, (파일 상태 정보의 최"
"종 수정 시각), B<-l> 옵션 추가: 최종 수정 시각과 이름으로 정렬 후 나열, 기"
"타: 최종 수정 시각 내림 차순으로 정렬"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-C>"
msgstr "B<-C>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "list entries by columns"
msgstr "열 별로 항목을 보여줍니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--color>[=I<\\,WHEN\\/>]"
msgstr "B<--color>[=I<\\,시기\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "color the output WHEN; more info below"
msgstr "I<시기>에 따라 색상 출력합니다. 자세한 내용은 하단 참조"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>, B<--directory>"
msgstr "B<-d>, B<--directory>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "list directories themselves, not their contents"
msgstr "디렉터리의 내용이 아닌 그 자체를 보여줍니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-D>, B<--dired>"
msgstr "B<-D>, B<--dired>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "generate output designed for Emacs' dired mode"
msgstr "이맥스 dir 방식으로 설계한 출력을 만듭니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>"
msgstr "B<-f>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not sort, enable B<-aU>, disable B<-ls> B<--color>"
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-F>, B<--classify>[=I<\\,WHEN\\/>]"
msgstr "B<-F>, B<--classify>[=I<\\,시기\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "append indicator (one of */=E<gt>@|) to entries WHEN"
msgstr "I<시기>에 따라 항목에 식별자(*/=E<gt>@| 중 하나)를 붙입니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--file-type>"
msgstr "B<--file-type>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "likewise, except do not append '*'"
msgstr "비슷하지만, '*'를 붙이는 경우를 제외합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--format>=I<\\,WORD\\/>"
msgstr "B<--format>=I<\\,단어\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"across B<-x>, commas B<-m>, horizontal B<-x>, long B<-l>, single-column "
"B<-1>, verbose B<-l>, vertical B<-C>"
msgstr ""
"across B<-x>, commas B<-m>, horizontal B<-x>, long B<-l>, single-column "
"B<-1>, verbose B<-l>, vertical B<-C>"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--full-time>"
msgstr "B<--full-time>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-l> B<--time-style>=I<\\,full-iso\\/>"
msgstr "B<-l> B<--time-style>=I<\\,full-iso\\/> 옵션과 유사함"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-g>"
msgstr "B<-g>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<-l>, but do not list owner"
msgstr "B<-l>과 같지만 소유주를 보여주지 않습니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--group-directories-first>"
msgstr "B<--group-directories-first>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"group directories before files; can be augmented with a B<--sort> option, "
"but any use of B<--sort>=I<\\,none\\/> (B<-U>) disables grouping"
msgstr ""
"파일 출력 전 디렉터리를 모읍니다. B<--sort> 옵션으로 동작을 확장할 수 있지"
"만, B<--sort>=I<\\,none\\/> (B<-U>) 옵션을 사용하면 분류 정렬 동작을 끌 수 있"
"습니다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-G>, B<--no-group>"
msgstr "B<-G>, B<--no-group>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "in a long listing, don't print group names"
msgstr "길게 보여주지만 그룹 이름은 출력하지 않음"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h>, B<--human-readable>"
msgstr "B<-h>, B<--human-readable>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "with B<-l> and B<-s>, print sizes like 1K 234M 2G etc."
msgstr "B<-l>, B<-s> 옵션과 같이, 1K 234M 2G 처럼 크기를 출력."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--si>"
msgstr "B<--si>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "likewise, but use powers of 1000 not 1024"
msgstr "비슷하지만 1024배수가 아닌 1000배수를 활용합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-H>, B<--dereference-command-line>"
msgstr "B<-H>, B<--dereference-command-line>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "follow symbolic links listed on the command line"
msgstr "명령행에 나타난 심볼릭 링크를 따라갑니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--dereference-command-line-symlink-to-dir>"
msgstr "B<--dereference-command-line-symlink-to-dir>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "follow each command line symbolic link that points to a directory"
msgstr "각 명령행에서 디렉터리를 가리키는 심볼릭 링크를 따라갑니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--hide>=I<\\,PATTERN\\/>"
msgstr "B<--hide>=I<\\,패턴\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"do not list implied entries matching shell PATTERN (overridden by B<-a> or "
"B<-A>)"
msgstr ""
"셸 I<패턴>에 일치하는 암시 항목은 나타내지 않습니다 (B<-a> 또는 B<-A>가 더 우"
"선함)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--hyperlink>[=I<\\,WHEN\\/>]"
msgstr "B<--hyperlink>[=I<\\,시기\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hyperlink file names WHEN"
msgstr "I<시기>에 맞춰 파일 이름의 하이퍼링크를 만듭니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--indicator-style>=I<\\,WORD\\/>"
msgstr "B<--indicator-style>=I<\\,단어\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"append indicator with style WORD to entry names: none (default), slash (B<-"
"p>), file-type (B<--file-type>), classify (B<-F>)"
msgstr ""
"항목 이름에 I<단어> 방식의 표시를 붙여둡니다: none (기본값), slash (B<-p>), "
"file-type (B<--file-type>), classify (B<-F>)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-i>, B<--inode>"
msgstr "B<-i>, B<--inode>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "print the index number of each file"
msgstr "각 파일의 인덱스 번호를 출력합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-I>, B<--ignore>=I<\\,PATTERN\\/>"
msgstr "B<-I>, B<--ignore>=I<\\,패턴\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "do not list implied entries matching shell PATTERN"
msgstr "셸 I<패턴>에 일치하는 암시 항목을 나타내지 않습니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-k>, B<--kibibytes>"
msgstr "B<-k>, B<--kibibytes>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"default to 1024-byte blocks for file system usage; used only with B<-s> and "
"per directory totals"
msgstr ""
"1024 바이트 블록을 파일 시스템 사용 정보 기본 단위로 합니다. 디렉터리별 총계"
"를 나타낼 때는 B<-s> 옵션만 함께 사용합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-l>"
msgstr "B<-l>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use a long listing format"
msgstr "긴 목록 형식으로 보여줍니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-L>, B<--dereference>"
msgstr "B<-L>, B<--dereference>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"when showing file information for a symbolic link, show information for the "
"file the link references rather than for the link itself"
msgstr ""
"심볼릭 링크 파일 정보를 보여줄 때 링크 자체를 보여주기 보다는 링크 참조의 파"
"일 정보를 보여줍니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-m>"
